abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a hierarchical, cascaded intent-aware routing
  framework for hybrid radio-frequency / visible light communication
  vehicular networks with UAV relays. Contains the dataset-generation and
  routing-evaluation notebooks, the three congestion-regime datasets used
  for every reported result, and MATLAB scripts that regenerate the
  manuscript figures.
keywords:
  - intent-based networking
  - visible light communication
  - VANET
  - FANET
  - UAV relaying
  - multi-criteria routing
  - analytic hierarchy process
license: MIT
